<title>UK: Glynwed year pretax rises to 86.3 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Glynwed year pretax rises to 86.3 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 28, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		23.53		  vs 26.08</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 12.75		  vs 12.75</p>
<p> Pretax		     86.3		   vs 84.9</p>
<p> Turnover		   1,323.7		vs 1,251.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 84 and 84.5 million stg. Figures were before an exceptional charge of 16.2 million stg for losses on disposals of businesses.</p>
<p>Full company name - Glynwed International Plc</p>
